# App HFSM integration

## Wiring

- Entry: `main.tscn` → `src/game/main.gd` boots HFSM (host for `HfsmSceneRegistry`)
- Config: `@export_file` → `src/game/hfsm/app_hfsm.json`
- Paths: `HfsmScenePaths` (`class_name`) child on Main; `SCENES` filled in `_ready` from `@export_category("Scenes")`

## Scenes (owned by HFSM)

| JSON id | Scene |
|---------|--------|
| `app_root` | `src/game/scenes/app_root/root.tscn` |
| `menu` | `src/game/scenes/menu/menu.tscn` |
| `game` | `src/game/scenes/game/game.tscn` |
| `post_battle` | `src/game/scenes/post_battle/post_battle.tscn` |

- Bridge: `RootEvents.ev_*` → `hfsm.add_event(...)` lives on **app_root** — not on `main.gd`
- App root is a normal `IScene`

## Events

| Resource signal | HFSM event |
|-----------------|------------|
| `ev_start_game` | `ev.start_game` |
| `ev_exit_game` | `ev.exit_game` |
| `ev_return_to_menu` | `ev.open_menu` |

## Must

- Keep `GameManager` battle FSM separate from app HFSM
- New app phase → JSON `scene` + `HfsmScenePaths` export + `.tscn`
- Do not put gameplay logic in `main.gd`
